{
 "end": 74.62,
 "fps": 30,
 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "at": 0.15,
   "dur": 5.333,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/01-0d3fca44c9.wav",
   "say": "Milo and Jay woke up on four wooden planks. No land. No boat. Just a rope hook, and a fin.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "at": 6.183,
   "dur": 2.901,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/02-84a27608bb.wav",
   "say": "Please tell me this isn't another one of your games.",
   "who": "J"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "at": 9.485,
   "dur": 3.243,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/03-c1620babc4.wav",
   "say": "Blackwater Drift. Okay. It's definitely one of my games.",
   "who": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "at": 13.227,
   "dur": 4.309,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/04-2ef55db511.wav",
   "say": "Throw the hook at anything floating. Reel it in. We build the raft ourselves.",
   "who": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "at": 18.137,
   "dur": 5.312,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/05-517552a393.wav",
   "say": "Barrels. Planks. Rope. Piece by piece, the raft grew. Walls. A sail. A fire to cook the fish.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "at": 24.149,
   "dur": 1.899,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/06-9ae72e477c.wav",
   "say": "Then the shark came back. Hungry.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "at": 26.347,
   "dur": 1.451,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/07-9d545a7a0d.wav",
   "say": "It's eating the raft!",
   "who": "J"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "at": 28.198,
   "dur": 2.709,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/08-dc003ef0e0.wav",
   "say": "Jay grabbed the iron spear. The shark swam off.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "at": 31.607,
   "dur": 3.925,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/09-fa8598b8de.wav",
   "say": "But Milo was watching the horizon. A wave. Taller than a house.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "at": 35.833,
   "dur": 1.387,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/10-e89ba33d06.wav",
   "say": "Brace! Hold on to something!",
   "who": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "at": 37.719,
   "dur": 1.941,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/11-a7cc250df0.wav",
   "say": "The raft climbed the wave, and held.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "at": 40.561,
   "dur": 5.803,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/12-c756689e09.wav",
   "say": "That night, the sea went quiet. Something huge rose beside the raft. Looked at them. And sank back down.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "at": 47.163,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/13-8e0df82cf9.wav",
   "say": "Milo. Did you code that?",
   "who": "J"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "at": 49.683,
   "dur": 1.557,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/14-bb22e2be17.wav",
   "say": "I don't remember coding that.",
   "who": "M"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "at": 52.141,
   "dur": 4.672,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/15-57e20ad60f.wav",
   "say": "At dawn, they found a whirlpool. Players paddle away from it. Milo paddled straight in.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "at": 57.413,
   "dur": 3.221,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/16-ae9ea1ea98.wav",
   "say": "Splash. Back on the bedroom floor. Soaked. Holding a fish.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "at": 61.234,
   "dur": 1.707,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/17-d8a108dcff.wav",
   "say": "I'm keeping the fish.",
   "who": "J"
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "at": 63.741,
   "dur": 4.523,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/18-7ebf1b6ad2.wav",
   "say": "Blackwater Drift is real, and it's on Pulsebox. Up to four friends on one raft.",
   "who": "N"
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "at": 68.863,
   "dur": 2.752,
   "file": "/home/user/pulseform/pulsebox/promo/stuck-ep2-blackwater/vo/19-2778796fcc.wav",
   "say": "Next time, they're not escaping. They're breaking in.",
   "who": "N"
  }
 ],
